cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Censoring-aware replenishment decision-support system (code)"
abstract: >-
  Code for "A censoring-aware decision-support system for perishable replenishment: turning latent
  demand recovery into service-level-optimal ordering". Recovers latent demand from hourly stockout
  labels, forecasts its distribution with LightGBM quantile models, converts it into critical-fractile
  orders, and evaluates decisions against known demand in a semi-synthetic world (FreshRetailNet-50K, M5).
type: software
